ariam 1.0.0
===========

First release of ariam, a personal fork of aria2 1.37.0 for HTTP(S)
and FTP downloads. Changes from aria2 1.37.0 are listed in README.rst.
BitTorrent, Metalink and WebSocket RPC are off by default and
unsupported. Control files are renamed <name>.ariam, so ariam does not
resume a download from an aria2 <name>.aria2 file.

